{"id":"cac_ador","lemma":"caçador","pos":"noun","rank":2238,"glosses":["hunter; huntsman (one who hunts animals)","hunter (one who searches for something meticulously)","chasseur (soldier equipped for rapid movement)"],"ipa":"/kɐ.sɐˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"caçadores","feminine":"caçadora","femininePlural":"caçadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-ca%C3%A7ador.wav","examples":[{"text":"O Tom é um caçador.","en":"Tom is a hunter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/491045","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"O caçador atirou num urso.","en":"The hunter shot a bear.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to throw","l":"atirar"},null,{"g":"bear"}]},{"text":"Alguns eram fazendeiros, outros eram caçadores.","en":"Some were farmers, some were hunters.","words":[{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"landowner","l":"fazendeiro"},{"g":"other one","l":"outro"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"O caçador seguiu as pegadas do urso.","en":"The hunter followed the bear's tracks.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"next","l":"pegado"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"bear"}]},{"text":"Os caçadores apontaram seus rifles para o elefante.","en":"The hunters aimed their rifles at the elephant.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"their or your kin"},{"g":"rifle","l":"rifle"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"elephant"}]}]}